  colors: TL=4, TR=5, BL=6, BR=9 [observed]; solver only requires 4 distinct non-bg colors
  fg_density: 25-75% per quadrant (4-12 of 16 pixels when N=M=4)
  connectivity: 1-4 connected components per mask; no constraint on shape
